    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        NavMorph: A Self-Evolving <span class="search-hit mathjax">World</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Model</span> for Vision-and-Language Navigation in Continuous Environments
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yao%2C+X">Xuan Yao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gao%2C+J">Junyu Gao</a>, 
      
