    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Towards foundational LiDAR <span class="search-hit mathjax">world</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">models</span> with efficient latent flow matching
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+T">Tianran Liu</a>, 
      
