    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        CronusVLA: Towards Efficient and Robust Manipulation via Multi-Frame <span class="search-hit mathjax">Vision</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Action</span> Modeling
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
