    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        TransDreamerV3: Implanting Transformer In DreamerV3
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dongare%2C+S+S">Shruti Sadanand Dongare</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kharel%2C+A">Amun Kharel</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Samuel%2C+J">Jonathan Samuel</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhou%2C+X">Xiaona Zhou</a>
      
    </p>
    
    <p class="abstract mathjax">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Abstract</span>:
      <span class="abstract-short has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2506.17103v1-abstract-short" style="display: inline;">
        &hellip;particularly in the Atari-Freeway and Crafter tasks. While issues in the Minecraft task and limited training across all tasks were noted, TransDreamerV3 displays advancement in <span class="search-hit mathjax">world</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span>-based reinforcement learning, leveraging transformer architectures.
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2506.17103v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('2506.17103v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
      </span>
      <span class="abstract-full has-text-grey-dark mathjax" id="2506.17103v1-abstract-full" style="display: none;">
        This paper introduces TransDreamerV3, a reinforcement learning model that enhances the DreamerV3 architecture by integrating a transformer encoder. The model is designed to improve memory and decision-making capabilities in complex environments. We conducted experiments on Atari-Boxing, Atari-Freeway, Atari-Pong, and Crafter tasks, where TransDreamerV3 demonstrated improved performance over DreamerV3, particularly in the Atari-Freeway and Crafter tasks. While issues in the Minecraft task and limited training across all tasks were noted, TransDreamerV3 displays advancement in <span class="search-hit mathjax">world</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span>-based reinforcement learning, leveraging transformer architectures.
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('2506.17103v1-abstract-full').style.display = 'none'; document.getElementById('2506.17103v1-abstract-short').style.display = 'inline';">&#9651; Less</a>
      </span>
    </p>
    

